hub.com/vpnhood/VpnHood/commit/4a85517bcceb27420823f6a7b480f29291f6fb9c","commit_subject":"Tests: the Kestrel parity tests start only once port 80 redirects to our own server's TLS port, and a probe whose reader or send fails other than by the connection's end fails, rather than passing as the server's answer; a bulk reply shows when its first and last bytes came, a handshake record shows the bytes left after its last message, a TLS tail the connection ended inside is marked cut, a backslash is escaped so it can't pass for an escaped line end, and the access manager is disposed when the server can't be made (Astra's second review)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"gpt-cmdr/ras-commander","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-30T00:55:34Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"96b6447c59af1277905e41af76631d5d05da0543","github_link":"https://github.com/gpt-cmdr/ras-commander/commit/96b6447c59af1277905e41af76631d5d05da0543","commit_subject":"Use the unsteady initialization as the starting method; screen each boundary","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"pdm-project/pdm","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-30T00:55:30Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"d8421451d446c00c9a301246a16a7260bcc71a42","github_link":"https://github.com/pdm-project/pdm/commit/d8421451d446c00c9a301246a16a7260bcc71a42","commit_subject":"fix(uv): preserve extras and markers for file requirements (#3965)","ai_tool":"Codex"},{"repo_name":"onnxsim/onnxsim","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-30T00:55:23Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"9294e8b75185fee832c6930a02dd668e3a2b28f6","github_link":"https://github.com/onnxsim/onnxsim/commit/9294e8b75185fee832c6930a02dd668e3a2b28f6","commit_subject":"Merge pull request #2272 from onnxsim/claude/pf-R4","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"mono/SkiaSharp","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-30T00:55:19Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"a5a4d2aab374f5c735fc62d404dcd086dde42ccd","github_link":"https://github.com/mono/SkiaSharp/commit/a5a4d2aab374f5c735fc62d404dcd086dde42ccd","commit_subject":"Clarify release audit